</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/03e853d4-a37d-11f1-8d3d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/Ukraine-warehouse.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/03e853d4-a37d-11f1-8d3d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/Ukraine-warehouse.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">751c9164-a382-11f1-bb19-5b9349b5d9d8</guid><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 08:57:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/03e853d4-a37d-11f1-8d3d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/Ukraine-warehouse.jpg">© Francisco Seco, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Russian strikes hit homes, warehouse, shopping mall across Ukraine</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/russian-strikes-hit-homes-warehouse-shopping-mall-across-ukraine</link><description>
