</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a0d4b4c0-a383-11f1-8544-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260829-100534-100718-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a0d4b4c0-a383-11f1-8544-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260829-100534-100718-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a57eb48a-a383-11f1-a714-5b9349b5d9d8</guid><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 08:51:53 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Icelanders vote in tight referendum on restarting EU membership talks</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260829-icelanders-vote-in-referendum-on-whether-to-resume-eu-membership-talks</link><description>
Iceland will vote Saturday in a tight referendum on whether to reopen membership negotiations with the European Union. Reykjavik applied for EU membership in 2009, following a financial crisis that devastated its economy, but a eurosceptic government suspended the process in 2013.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3c3d8ef4-a376-11f1-8a6e-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26239717725586.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3c3d8ef4-a376-11f1-8a6e-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26239717725586.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c5bb2fb4-a372-11f1-8597-6988c7472b7c</guid><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 06:56:50 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/3c3d8ef4-a376-11f1-8a6e-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26239717725586.jpg">© Marco Di Marco, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Norway mourns King Harald as Haakon prepares to take the throne</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/norway-mourns-king-harald-as-haakon-prepares-to-take-the-throne</link><description>
Norway is mourning King Harald V after the country's longest-serving monarch died at the age of 89, with tributes pouring in from across Europe. His death paves the way for Crown Prince Haakon to become king, as the royal family faces renewed scrutiny over Crown Princess Mette-Marit's reported past ties to Jeffrey Epstein and the conviction of her son for rape.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d51c7b0a-a2ac-11f1-b15b-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP23128282047679.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d51c7b0a-a2ac-11f1-b15b-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP23128282047679.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">cbf50fa6-a2f7-11f1-ba9c-d51a1081e713</guid><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:31:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Greenland to open truth commission over forced contraception scheme</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260828-greenland-to-open-truth-commission-over-forced-contraception-scheme</link><description>
Greenland's government said Friday it would ⁠establish a Truth and Reconciliation Commission to shed light on a campaign of forced contraception carried out by Danish authorities from the 1960s to 1990, after experts failed to agree on whether the practice constituted genocide. The brutal campaign saw thousands of Indignous women and girls receive intrauterine devices or contraceptive injections without their consent. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/41e396d6-a2fa-11f1-8079-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/3be3985795f659a76ed2aa712fb606175199b1cf.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/41e396d6-a2fa-11f1-8079-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/3be3985795f659a76ed2aa712fb606175199b1cf.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">437f96ca-a2fa-11f1-889d-0bbe93ac1408</guid><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:05:16 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/41e396d6-a2fa-11f1-8079-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/3be3985795f659a76ed2aa712fb606175199b1cf.jpg">© Mads Claus Rasmussen, Ritzau Scanpix, AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
